        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh no! Ducky has tumbled from it's nest on the floating farm high above the clouds! Jump your way to the top through a whimsical world in <strong>Uppies!</strong>, a singleplayer <strong>family-friendly platformer</strong> where your mission is to guide Ducky back to it's family. Prepare for a challenging experience as you navigate a series of increasingly difficult obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome each obstacle with skill and determination. Don't be discouraged by falls, as every setback is an opportunity to learn and improve! <strong>Problem-solving skills</strong> are essential as you strategize your ascent through the environments. With <strong>generous checkpoints</strong> scattered throughout the levels, Uppies! offers a forgiving and enjoyable experience for players of all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you finally unite Ducky with their family, the adventure doesn't have to end. For ambitious players, <strong>Uppies!</strong> includes the option to reset the game so you can sharpen your skills and strive for the perfect run in this engaging and replayable precision platformer. Are you ready to take on the <strong>climbing challenge</strong> and help Ducky return home?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh no! Ducky has tumbled from it's nest on the floating farm high above the clouds! Jump your way to the top through a whimsical world in <strong>Uppies!</strong>, a singleplayer <strong>family-friendly platformer</strong> where your mission is to guide Ducky back to it's family. Prepare for a challenging experience as you navigate a series of increasingly difficult obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome each obstacle with skill and determination. Don't be discouraged by falls, as every setback is an opportunity to learn and improve! <strong>Problem-solving skills</strong> are essential as you strategize your ascent through the environments. With <strong>generous checkpoints</strong> scattered throughout the levels, Uppies! offers a forgiving and enjoyable experience for players of all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you finally unite Ducky with their family, the adventure doesn't have to end. For ambitious players, <strong>Uppies!</strong> includes the option to reset the game so you can sharpen your skills and strive for the perfect run in this engaging and replayable precision platformer. Are you ready to take on the <strong>climbing challenge</strong> and help Ducky return home?</p>",
        "short_description": "A family friendly platformer, problem solving and overcoming obstacles to reunite Ducky with it's family on the floating farm.",
